## 4. الـ Schema: key ← type

### `users/{uid}`
**الـ Document ID لازم يكون نفس الـ `uid` بتاع Firebase Auth.**

| Key | Type | قيمة مثال |
|---|---|---|
| `name` | string | `"أحمد علي"` |
| `phone` | string | `"01012345678"` |
| `email` | string | `"ahmed@mail.com"` |
| `role` | string | `"customer"` أو `"admin"` |
| `status` | string | `"active"` / `"pending"` / `"rejected"` |
| `location` | map | للـ customer بس، وتفاصيله تحت |
| `approvedBy` | string | uid الـ admin اللي وافق (للـ admins بس) |
| `approvedAt` | timestamp | |
| `createdAt` | timestamp | |
| `updatedAt` | timestamp | |

جوه `location` (map):

| Key | Type |
|---|---|
| `lat` | number (double) |
| `lng` | number (double) |
| `accuracyM` | number |
| `address` | string |
| `details` | string |
| `capturedAt` | timestamp |

### `products/{productId}`

| Key | Type | ملاحظة |
|---|---|---|
| `name` | string | |
| `nameLower` | string | normalized عشان الـ search |
| `description` | string | |
| `price` | number | لازم `> 0` |
| `imageVersion` | number (int) | بيبدأ بـ `1` |
| `stock` | number (**int**) | لازم يكون `>= 0` وقت الـ create |
| `activeQty` | number (int) | لازم يكون `0` وقت الـ create |
| `totalQty` | number (int) | لازم يكون `0` وقت الـ create |
| `isActive` | boolean | |
| `createdBy` | string | admin uid |
| `createdAt` / `updatedAt` | timestamp | |

### `productImages/{productId}`
نفس الـ ID بتاع الـ product.

| Key | Type |
|---|---|
| `data` | bytes (≤ 300 KB) |
| `contentType` | string (`"image/jpeg"`) |
| `updatedAt` | timestamp |

### `orders/{orderId}`

| Key | Type |
|---|---|
| `shortCode` | string |
| `customerId` | string |
| `customerName` / `customerPhone` | string |
| `location` | map (نفس شكل location اللي فوق) |
| `items` | array of map: `{productId: string, name: string, price: number, qty: int, lineTotal: number}` |
| `productIds` | array of string |
| `itemsCount` | number (int) |
| `total` | number |
| `note` | string |
| `status` | string: `pending` / `inProgress` / `done` / `cancelled` |
| `statusHistory` | array of map: `{status: string, at: timestamp, by: string}` |
| `cancelReason` | string (أو مش موجود خالص) |
| `updatedBy` | string |
| `createdAt` / `updatedAt` | timestamp |

