## 6. مثال `toMap()` بالـ types الصح

```dart
Map<String, dynamic> toMap() => {
  'name': name,
  'nameLower': normalizeArabic(name),
  'description': description,
  'price': price,                 // double
  'imageVersion': imageVersion,   // int
  'stock': stock,                 // int، لو بقى 10.0 الـ rule `is int` هترفضه
  'activeQty': 0,
  'totalQty': 0,
  'isActive': isActive,           // bool
  'createdBy': uid,
  'createdAt': FieldValue.serverTimestamp(),
  'updatedAt': FieldValue.serverTimestamp(),
};
```

